$ oikade forget
Error: oikade forget takes the devices to forget, or --plugin NAME
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade forget --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade forget secret/api-key
Error: oikade forget takes devices, and a secret is removed, not forgotten
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade remove secret/api-key removes it
exit 2

$ oikade forget client/old-laptop
Error: oikade forget takes devices, and a client is removed, not forgotten
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade remove client/old-laptop removes it
exit 2

$ oikade forget plugin/relays
Error: oikade forget takes devices, not plugin/relays
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade forget --plugin relays forgets every device of it
exit 2

$ oikade forget room/hall
Error: oikade forget takes devices, not room/hall
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: give each as device/NAME, or its name alone
exit 2

$ oikade forget matter
Error: oikade forget takes devices, and matter is the Matter bridge
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: a device called matter is device/matter
exit 2

$ oikade forget porch-light --plugin relays
Error: oikade forget takes devices or --plugin NAME, not both
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade forget --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade forget Porch
Error: "Porch" isn't a device's name, or a ref such as device/desk-plug or flow/morning
Usage:
  oikade forget DEVICE... [--allow-safety] [--json]
  oikade forget --plugin NAME [--allow-safety] [--json]
Hint: oikade forget --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade remove
Error: oikade remove takes the secrets and clients to remove, such as secret/api-key
Usage:
  oikade remove REF... [--json]
Hint: oikade remove --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade remove porch-light
Error: oikade remove takes secret/NAME or client/NAME, not porch-light
Usage:
  oikade remove REF... [--json]
Hint: oikade remove secret/porch-light removes a secret, and oikade forget porch-light forgets a device
exit 2

$ oikade remove device/porch-light
Error: oikade remove doesn't take devices: a device is forgotten, as its plugin may report it again
Usage:
  oikade remove REF... [--json]
Hint: oikade forget device/porch-light forgets it
exit 2

$ oikade remove plugin/relays
Error: oikade remove takes secret/NAME or client/NAME, not plugin/relays
Usage:
  oikade remove REF... [--json]
Hint: oikade remove --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade remove client/Bad
Error: "client/Bad" isn't a ref: "Bad" isn't a client name: use lowercase letters, digits and single dashes, starting with a letter, such as "bad"
Usage:
  oikade remove REF... [--json]
Hint: oikade remove --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade secret remove api-key
Error: oikade secret doesn't remove secrets any more
Usage:
  oikade secret set NAME [--json]
Hint: oikade remove secret/api-key does
exit 2

$ oikade client revoke old-laptop
Error: oikade has no client command
Hint: oikade list clients lists them, and oikade remove client/NAME removes one
exit 2

$ oikade devices remove porch-light
Error: oikade has no devices command
Hint: oikade list devices lists them, and oikade forget DEVICE forgets one
exit 2

$ oikade revoke
Error: oikade has no revoke command
Hint: oikade remove client/NAME removes a client, and its token stops working
exit 2

$ oikade rm
Error: oikade has no rm command
Hint: oikade remove REF removes a secret or a client, and oikade forget DEVICE forgets a device
exit 2

$ oikade add
Error: oikade has no add command
Hint: oikade-host add client/NAME, on the host's machine, adds a client
exit 2

